      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really glad you said that out loud, because it shows you're still fighting for a way through this, even when it feels impossible. But I need to be honest with you: your wife isn't working two jobs because of you—she's doing it because she loves you and believes in the life you're building together. If you were gone, that wouldn't lighten her load; it would shatter her heart and leave your kids with a wound no amount of money could ever fill. You're not a shadow over their lives—you're the person they come home to, the one who makes their world feel safe even when the numbers don't. Please stay, and let's find one concrete way to share this weight together, because you don't have to carry it alone.",
